            "heading": "Common questions",
            "items": [
              {
                "question": "How does the first consultation work?",
                "answer": "It is a free 45-minute call or meeting where we learn about your business and suggest where we can help. No obligation."
              },
              {
                "question": "What does an engagement cost?",
                "answer": "Most projects are fixed-fee between $2,500 and $12,000 depending on scope. You will know the price before we start."
              },
              {
                "question": "Do you only work with local businesses?",
                "answer": "Most of our clients are in Oregon and Washington, but we work remotely with companies across the US."
              },
              {
                "question": "How long does a typical project take?",
                "answer": "Between four and twelve weeks, followed by optional monthly advisory sessions."
              }
            ]
          },
